      "score": 142,
      "comments": 27,
      "author": "yoelcabo",
      "published": "2026-08-06T11:22:20Z",
      "bullets": [
        "An authorization failure in AI meeting recorder tl;dv exposed 181,874 meeting transcripts and video recordings to unauthorized public access.",
        "The vulnerability involved missing validation on object references, allowing unauthenticated attackers to enumerate and fetch stored meeting data.",
        "Security teams should audit third-party AI bot integrations for broken object-level authorization (BOLA) and enforce strict tenant isolation."
      ]
    },
