      "bullets": [
        "AMD's acquisition of Taalas integrates custom ASIC designs that hardwire specific AI model weights directly onto silicon die.",
        "Hardwiring models into ASICs eliminates dynamic memory overhead, yielding orders-of-magnitude improvements in AI inference efficiency and latency.",
        "The strategy allows AMD to challenge NVIDIA in low-cost inference by trading post-fabrication model flexibility for raw hardware throughput."
